From 8a28b95586671561708dc42eefe1ed7edd4a9cc3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiniMe Team <team@example.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 18:42:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add live-synced team to-do merged with the master timeline

todo.html: tasks, board, timeline and per-person workload. Any start and end
date; the default start is today and the default end is 7 days later. Time
past the target day is drawn in amber, time past the hard deadline in red, and
tasks past their deadline get their own Failed box.

api/todo.js + sync.js: shared storage in a hosted Redis (no login), live sync
with offline queue, newest edit per record wins, deletes are tombstones, and a
daily server snapshot is kept for 35 days.

data/master-timeline.js: the master timeline items, now shared by roadmap.html
and todo.html. roadmap.html reads and writes its dates through the shared
store and moves a browser's old local dates over once.

data/todo.json: starter data, loaded once into an empty database.
README: one-time database setup.
